      "standard_id": "icat-schema",
      "name": "ICAT Schema",
      "description": "A versioned metadata schema for the ICAT data catalogue describing core scientific entities and their relationships: Facility, Instrument, Investigation, Dataset, Datafile, DataCollection, Sample, User/Groupings and authorization Rules, Job and Application links, Types and Parameters (e.g. ParameterType, DatafileFormat). Specifies entity attributes (id, createId, createTime, modId, modTime) and facility-scoped parameter/type namespaces; schema is generated from the code and published per ICAT release (e.g. 4.10.0)."
    }
